      "en": "These things contain an allegory, for these are two covenants. One is from Mount Sinai, bearing children to bondage, which is Hagar.",
      "ko": "이것은 비유니 이 여자들은 두 언약이라 하나는 시내산으로부터 종을 낳은 자니 곧 하가라",
      "source_text_hash": "9fc5988ba3702d6df70800bdaed0be9be01ae97e94c527b27422b23c72b3ac0e",
      "translation_text_hash": "3adb5a3c3aa94a726d9447aab8a2a5581243336b66c040c156db343febd72edb",
